OL,3,A'I love to escape into a fantasyland of
OL,4,Afairies': Fans rejoice as new A Court
OL,5,Aof Thorns and Roses book hits shelves
OL,6,
OL,7,FTorrential rain and high winds may not
OL,8,Fbe what many would consider
OL,9,Ffantastical.
OL,11,FBut it didn't stop about 30 hardcore
OL,12,Ffans turning out for the latest release
OL,13,Fof author Sarah J Maas' romantasy
OL,14,Fseries, A Court of Splintered Harmony,
OL,15,Fin Carrickfergus, County Antrim.
OL,17,FThe sixth book in Maas's multi-million
OL,18,Fbook selling series, A Court of Thorns
OL,19,Fand Roses (ACOTAR), was released at
OL,20,Fmidnight on Tuesday after a five-year
OL,21,Fwait.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,166,160,200,105,0,100
